        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Well, I've been afraid of changin'&lt;br /&gt;'Cause I've built my life around you&lt;br /&gt;But time makes you bolder&lt;br /&gt;Even children get older&lt;br /&gt;And I'm getting older too&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
